/70">07:00 to 18:00 daily</li><li class="py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-charcoal/70">96 seats inside and out</li></ul><button class="mt-6 inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-charcoal px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone transition-colors hover:bg-forest" type="button">Reserve a table<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-charcoal opacity-0" data-venue-shade="true"></div></div></article><article aria-labelledby="venue-1" class="lg:sticky lg:top-[calc(6rem+var(--stack)*1.5rem)] lg:mb-16 lg:h-[min(76svh,720px)] lg:last:mb-0" data-venue="true" style="--stack:1"><div class="relative grid h-full origin-top overflow-hidden rounded-[6px] bg-paper shadow-[0_30px_80px_-40px_rgba(27,27,25,0.45)] lg:grid-cols-12" data-venue-inner="true"><div class="relative aspect-[4/3] lg:col-span-7 lg:aspect-auto"><img alt="White fish and prawns with an orange sauce and herbs on a textured plate" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 58vw, 100vw" src="/images/dining-plate-1.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-10 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:col-span-5 lg:p-12"><div><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-charcoal/55 sm:text-[11px]">02<!-- --> · <!-- -->Tasting menu</p><h3 class="mt-5 font-serif text-[clamp(2.4rem,4vw,4.2rem)] leading-[0.95]" id="venue-1">Cellar Room</h3><p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75">Twenty-four seats beneath the clubhouse and a menu that changes with the estate garden, paired with wines from the surrounding valley.</p></div><div><ul class="divide-y divide-charcoal/10 border-y border-charcoal/10"><li class="py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-charcoal/70">Wednesday to Sunday from 19:30</li><li class="py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-charcoal/70">24 seats</li></ul><button class="mt-6 inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-charcoal px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone transition-colors hover:bg-forest" type="button">Reserve a table<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-charcoal opacity-0" data-venue-shade="true"></div></div></article><article aria-labelledby="venue-2" class="lg:sticky lg:top-[calc(6rem+var(--stack)*1.5rem)] lg:mb-16 lg:h-[min(76svh,720px)] lg:last:mb-0" data-venue="true" style="--stack:2"><div class="relative grid h-full origin-top overflow-hidden rounded-[6px] bg-paper shadow-[0_30px_80px_-40px_rgba(27,27,25,0.45)] lg:grid-cols-12" data-venue-inner="true"><div class="relative aspect-[4/3] lg:col-span-7 lg:aspect-auto"><img alt="A low stone pavilion with wide windows set into the dunes" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 58vw, 100vw" src="/images/clubhouse-3.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-10 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:col-span-5 lg:p-12"><div><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-charcoal/55 sm:text-[11px]">03<!-- --> · <!-- -->A