om the first tee.</p></div><div><ul class="divide-y divide-charcoal/10 border-y border-charcoal/10"><li class="py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-charcoal/70">24 lodges</li><li class="py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-charcoal/70">One to four bedrooms</li></ul><button class="mt-6 inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-charcoal px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone transition-colors hover:bg-forest" type="button">Plan a stay<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-charcoal opacity-0" data-venue-shade="true"></div></div></article></div></div></section>
